---
interface Props {storageKey?:string}
const {storageKey='omc:club:may-summer-rhythm:v1'}=Astro.props;
const blocks=[
 {key:'morning',title:'Morning Start',time:'8:00',desc:'Breakfast · Get dressed · Make beds',icon:'/images/club/icon-library/morning-start.png',tint:'#F8E8B5'},
 {key:'move',title:'Move & Play',time:'9:00',desc:'Outside · Bikes · Park · Backyard',icon:'/images/club/icon-library/move-play.png',tint:'#F4DEA3'},
 {key:'create',title:'Create & Explore',time:'10:30',desc:'Read · Build · Draw · Make',icon:'/images/club/icon-library/create-explore.png',tint:'#F0D493'},
 {key:'lunch',title:'Lunch & Reset',time:'12:00',desc:'Eat · Clear dishes · Tidy up',icon:'/images/club/icon-library/lunch-reset.png',tint:'#DDEBDB'},
 {key:'quiet',title:'Quiet Time',time:'1:00',desc:'Read · Puzzles · Quiet play',icon:'/images/club/icon-library/quiet-time.png',tint:'#D1E5D6'},
 {key:'free',title:'Free Afternoon',time:'2:00',desc:'Friends · Outings · Free play',icon:'/images/club/icon-library/free-afternoon.png',tint:'#C3DDCF'},
 {key:'evening',title:'Evening Reset',time:'Evening',desc:'Pick up · Wash up · Wind down',icon:'/images/club/icon-library/evening-reset.png',tint:'#D1D7EA'},
];
---
<div class="msr" data-msr-key={storageKey}>
 <header class="msr-intro"><a href="/club">← Organized Family Club</a><p class="msr-label">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · MAY 2027</p><h1>Less reminding. <em>More summer freedom.</em></h1><p>A picture-led rhythm kids can check for themselves, prepared for your family and ready for the refrigerator.</p></header>
 <div class="msr-layout">
  <aside class="msr-editor" aria-label="Prepared May summer rhythm">
   <div class="msr-editor-head"><p class="msr-label">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · MAY 2027</p><h2>Less reminding. <em>More summer freedom.</em></h2><button type="button" class="msr-vision-button" data-open-vision>Why this matters <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></button></div>
   <div class="msr-prepared" id="may-edit-controls">
    <span class="msr-label">YOUR FAMILY'S PREPARED RHYTHM</span>
    <strong>Our Summer Day</strong>
    <p>Seven familiar anchors your kids can check without asking Mom what comes next.</p>
    <div class="msr-summary-line"><span>Day type</span><b data-summary-days>Mostly at home</b></div>
    <div class="msr-summary-line"><span>Structure</span><b data-summary-structure>Balanced</b></div>
    <div class="msr-summary-line"><span>Morning start</span><b data-summary-start>8:00 AM</b></div>
    <div class="msr-summary-line"><span>Quiet time</span><b data-summary-quiet>Independent play</b></div>
    <button type="button" class="msr-edit-trigger" data-open-editor>Make changes <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></button>
   </div>
   <p class="msr-subnote">A reusable rhythm, not a rigid schedule. Trips, camps and appointments fit around the anchors that work for your family.</p>
   <div class="msr-actions">
    <div class="msr-primary-actions"><a class="msr-jump-edit" href="#may-edit-controls">Make changes <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"/></svg></a><button type="button" data-print>Print / Save PDF</button></div>
    <button type="button" class="msr-download" data-download>Download image (PNG)</button>
    <button type="button" data-reset class="msr-reset">Restore suggested rhythm</button>
   </div>
  </aside>
  <dialog class="msr-dialog msr-vision-dialog" data-vision-dialog aria-labelledby="msr-vision-title">
   <div class="msr-dialog-top"><div><span class="msr-label">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · MAY</span><h2 id="msr-vision-title">Why this matters</h2></div><button type="button" class="msr-dialog-close" data-close-modal aria-label="Close"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button></div>
   <p>When school ends, the daily structure disappears, and Mom becomes the one everyone asks what to do next. This illustrated rhythm gives children a simple place to look for their next activity while keeping the day flexible. We've prepared realistic anchors and activity ideas, so Mom doesn't have to invent and announce the plan all summer long.</p>
   <button type="button" class="msr-dialog-done" data-close-modal>Back to our plan</button>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="msr-dialog msr-edit-dialog" data-editor-dialog aria-labelledby="msr-edit-title">
   <div class="msr-dialog-top"><div><span class="msr-label">MAKE IT YOURS · MAY</span><h2 id="msr-edit-title">Edit your summer rhythm</h2></div><button type="button" class="msr-dialog-close" data-close-modal aria-label="Close"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button></div>
   <p>The rhythm is ready to use. Change only what needs to fit your family.</p>
   <div class="msr-dialog-form">   <label>Kind of summer day<select data-days><option value="home">Mostly at home</option><option value="camp">Camp or a program</option></select></label>
   <fieldset class="msr-structure"><legend>How much structure?</legend>
    <label><input type="radio" name="msr-structure" value="relaxed" /> Relaxed <small>Five broad anchors; no set times</small></label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="msr-structure" value="balanced" checked /> Balanced <small>Seven blocks with flexible times</small></label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="msr-structure" value="structured" /> More structured <small>Seven blocks with specific times</small></label>
   </fieldset>
   <label>Morning starts<select data-start><option value="7">7:00 AM</option><option value="7.5">7:30 AM</option><option value="8" selected>8:00 AM</option><option value="8.5">8:30 AM</option><option value="9">9:00 AM</option><option value="9.5">9:30 AM</option></select></label>
   <label>Quiet time<select data-quiet><option value="independent">Independent play and reading</option><option value="rest">Rest or nap</option><option value="older">Independent recharge</option></select></label>
   <label>Favorite kind of play<select data-play><option value="outdoors">Outdoor play</option><option value="active">Sports and movement</option><option value="creative">Making and creativity</option><option value="mixed">A mix of everything</option></select></label>
   <details class="msr-customize" data-customize>
    <summary>Edit activities on mobile <span>Optional</span></summary>
    <p>These seven blocks are already prepared. Change any title, activity or time, or move a block up or down. Changes appear on the printable immediately.</p>
    <div data-edit-rows class="msr-edit-rows"></div>
   </details>
   <div class="msr-removed" data-removed-container hidden><strong>Removed blocks</strong><div data-removed-actions></div><p>Tap a block to add it back without losing your other changes.</p></div>
</div>
   <button type="button" class="msr-dialog-done" data-close-modal>Done · See our plan</button>
  </dialog>
  <section class="msr-preview" aria-label="May illustrated rhythm board preview">
   <button type="button" class="msr-floating-edit" data-open-editor aria-label="Make changes to your plan"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5 4 4M4 20l4-.8L19 8.2a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 16.2 4 20Z"/></svg><span>MAKE CHANGES</span></button>
   
   <div class="msr-stage" data-stage><article class="msr-sheet" data-sheet>
    <div class="msr-sheet-head"><span>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · MAY 2027</span><h2>Our <em>Summer Day</em></h2><p>A little structure. Plenty of freedom.</p></div>
    <div class="msr-family"><span data-family>OUR FAMILY'S SUMMER RHYTHM</span><span data-day-label>A DAY AT HOME</span></div>
    <div class="msr-rows" data-print-rows>
     {blocks.map((b,i)=><div class="msr-row" data-rhythm-key={b.key} style={'--msr-tint:'+b.tint}>
      <div class="msr-icon-box"><img src={b.icon} alt="" width="70" height="70" loading="eager" class="msr-icon" /></div>
      <div class="msr-row-copy"><h3 data-title contenteditable="true" spellcheck="true" role="textbox" aria-label={`Edit ${b.title} name`}>{b.title}</h3><p data-desc contenteditable="true" spellcheck="true" role="textbox" aria-label={`Edit ${b.title} activities`}>{b.desc}</p></div>
      <span class="msr-time" data-time role="button" tabindex="0" title="Click to change this time" aria-label={`Change ${b.title} time`}>{b.time}</span>
      <div class="msr-row-actions" aria-label={`Edit ${b.title} position`}><button type="button" data-move-up aria-label={`Move ${b.title} earlier`} title="Move earlier">↑</button><button type="button" data-move-down aria-label={`Move ${b.title} later`} title="Move later">↓</button><button type="button" data-remove aria-label={`Remove ${b.title}`} title="Remove block">×</button></div>
     </div>)}
    </div>
    <div class="msr-rule"><span>OUR SUMMER RULE</span><strong>Check the rhythm before asking Mom.</strong><p>Our plans can change. We can still find what's next.</p></div>
    <footer class="msr-foot"><span>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB</span><span>OUR SUMMER DAY · MAY</span></footer>
   </article></div>
   
  </section>
 </div>
</div>
<style is:global>
.msr,.msr *{box-sizing:border-box}.msr{font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#454a43;max-width:1480px;margin:0 auto;padding:25px clamp(18px,3.5vw,52px) 65px}.msr-intro{max-width:760px;margin:0 0 38px}.msr-intro>a{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;color:inherit;margin-bottom:28px}.msr-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#62765e}.msr-intro h1{font:400 clamp(37px,4.5vw,60px)/1.12 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0 16px}.msr-intro h1 em{color:#6b8464}.msr-intro>p:last-child{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}.msr-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,360px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(22px,4vw,64px)}.msr-editor{border-top:8px solid #d4dfc4;padding-top:19px}.msr-editor h2{font:italic 29px Georgia,serif;color:#5a7154;margin:12px 0}.msr-editor>p:nth-of-type(2){font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:23px}.msr-editor label{display:block;border-top:1px solid #dfe5d9;margin-top:16px;padding-top:15px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.msr-editor select{display:block;width:100%;min-height:45px;margin-top:8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #aab6a3;background:white;color:#464d42;font:13px Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif}.msr-message{background:#f1f5ee;margin:25px 0 20px;padding:19px}.msr-message strong{font:400 20px Georgia,serif;color:#506849}.msr-message p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin:10px 0 0}.msr-editor button[data-print]{display:block;width:100%;border:0;background:#4f654b;color:#fff;padding:16px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.msr-download{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:10px;background:#fff;color:#4f654b;border:1px solid #9aaf94;min-height:45px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;font-size:12px}.msr-download:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:wait}.msr-reset{display:block;margin:10px auto;background:none;border:0;color:#4c6046;text-decoration:underline;min-height:40px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}.msr-note{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#777}.msr-preview{min-width:0}.msr-preview-head{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe5d9;margin-bottom:20px}.msr-preview-head h2{font:400 26px Georgia,serif}.msr-preview-head span{font-size:12px;color:#777}.msr-stage{position:relative}.msr-sheet{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:816px;height:1056px;padding:38px 48px 23px;border:1px solid #e2e7df;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0002;background:white;color:#464e44;transform:scale(var(--msr-scale,.8));transform-origin:top left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}.msr-sheet-head{background:#e4eddc;border-top:9px solid #cbdcbf;min-height:153px;padding:19px 28px}.msr-sheet-head>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;color:#526849}.msr-sheet-head h2{font:400 50px/1.1 Georgia,serif;color:#3f5a40;margin:10px 0 6px}.msr-sheet-head p{font:italic 17px Georgia,serif;color:#587052;margin:0}.msr-family{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin:19px 0 12px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#687866}.msr-rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.msr-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:80px minmax(0,1fr) 144px;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:86px;padding:5px 16px 5px 7px;border:1px solid #e4e8e0;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--msr-tint) 0%,#fff 88%)}.msr-icon-box{width:70px;height:70px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--msr-tint);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.msr-icon{width:60px;height:60px;object-fit:contain;display:block;mix-blend-mode:multiply}.msr-row-copy h3{font:400 24px/1.1 Georgia,serif;color:#455644;margin:0 0 7px}.msr-row-copy p{font:12px/1.45 Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5d685b;margin:0}.msr-time{font-size:29.4px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em;color:#577350;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;min-width:130px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.msr-rule{background:#edf3e9;border-radius:7px;margin-top:16px;padding:14px 15px;text-align:center}.msr-rule span{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:700;color:#687c61}.msr-rule strong{display:block;font:400 22px Georgia,serif;color:#3e5e3f;margin:5px 0}.msr-rule p{margin:0;font-size:11px;color:#647960}.msr-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #dfe6dc;margin-top:auto;padding-top:9px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700;color:#687964}


/* Direct editing belongs to the digital preview, never the mailed printable. */
.msr-row{position:relative}
.msr-row-actions{position:absolute;z-index:4;top:-12px;right:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .12s}
.msr-row:hover .msr-row-actions,.msr-row:focus-within .msr-row-actions{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.msr-row-actions button{width:28px;height:28px;padding:0;border:1px solid #afbdab;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;color:#3f5a40;box-shadow:0 1px 4px #0002;font:700 17px Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}
.msr-row-actions button:hover{background:#e6f0e1}
.msr-row-actions button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}
.msr-row-copy [contenteditable]{cursor:text;outline-offset:3px;border-radius:3px}
.msr-row-copy [contenteditable]:hover{outline:1px dashed #9baf94}
.msr-row-copy [contenteditable]:focus{outline:2px solid #6f9866;background:#f7faf5}
.msr-time[role=button]{cursor:pointer;border-radius:4px;outline-offset:3px}
.msr-time[role=button]:hover{outline:1px dashed #9baf94}
.msr-time[role=button]:focus{outline:2px solid #6f9866}
.msr-meridiem{color:#A2AAA3;font-size:60%;letter-spacing:0;vertical-align:baseline}
.msr-time input[type=time]{width:145px;padding:6px 3px;max-width:none;background:#fff;border:1px solid #83a177;border-radius:4px;color:#3f5a40;font:700 15px Arial,sans-serif}
.msr-removed{border:1px solid #cbd8c5;margin-top:18px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:6px}
.msr-removed strong{display:block;font:600 12px Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#52684b;margin-bottom:8px}
.msr-removed [data-removed-actions]{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
.msr-removed button{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #b4c5aa;border-radius:18px;background:#f7faf5;color:#3b5839;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}
.msr-removed p{color:#6b7867;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin:10px 0 0}
.msr-row[hidden]{display:none!important}
.msr-removed[hidden]{display:none!important}
@media(min-width:1081px){.msr-customize{display:none}}
@media(max-width:1080px){.msr-row-actions{display:none}.msr-row-copy [contenteditable]{pointer-events:none}.msr-time[role=button]{pointer-events:none}}
@media print{.msr-row-actions{display:none!important}.msr-row-copy [contenteditable]{outline:none!important;background:transparent!important}.msr-time[role=button]{outline:none!important}}
.msr.msr-exporting .msr-row-actions{display:none!important}
.msr.msr-exporting .msr-row-copy [contenteditable]{outline:none!important;background:transparent!important}

/* May editor: finished product stays central; detailed changes are opt-in. */
.msr-row[hidden]{display:none!important}
.msr.msr-exporting .msr-stage{width:816px!important;height:1056px!important}
.msr.msr-exporting .msr-sheet{transform:none!important;position:relative!important;left:0!important;top:0!important;box-shadow:none!important}
.msr-structure{border:0;border-top:1px solid #dfe5d9;margin:18px 0 8px;padding:13px 0 0;min-width:0}
.msr-structure legend{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:0}
.msr-editor .msr-structure label{border:0;margin:0;padding:8px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.msr-structure input{width:17px;height:17px;accent-color:#587554;flex:0 0 17px}
.msr-structure small{font-size:10px;line-height:1.35;color:#757f72;font-weight:400;margin-left:auto;text-align:right;max-width:165px}
.msr-customize{border:1px solid #cbd8c5;margin-top:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff}
.msr-customize summary{cursor:pointer;padding:15px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#3d5a3d;list-style-position:inside}
.msr-customize summary span{font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:#697b68;margin-left:5px}
.msr-customize>p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;padding:0 15px 12px;color:#6c7468}
.msr-edit-rows{padding:0 12px 12px;display:grid;gap:10px}
.msr-edit-row{border:1px solid #e2e9de;border-radius:5px;padding:10px 12px;background:#fafbf8}
.msr-edit-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:9px}
.msr-edit-top>span{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#52684b}
.msr-edit-buttons{display:flex;gap:5px}
.msr-edit-buttons button{border:1px solid #c9d6c3;background:#fff;color:#3d5a3d;font-size:13px;min-width:32px;min-height:32px;cursor:pointer}
.msr-edit-buttons button:disabled{opacity:.3;cursor:default}
.msr-editor .msr-edit-row label{border:0;margin:0 0 7px;padding:0;font-weight:600;font-size:10px}
.msr-edit-row input{display:block;width:100%;border:1px solid #cbd7c4;border-radius:3px;padding:8px;font:12px Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#404a3e;margin-top:4px;min-height:36px}
.msr-edit-row .msr-edit-clock{width:120px}
.msr[data-msr-structure="relaxed"] .msr-time{display:none}
.msr[data-msr-structure="relaxed"] .msr-row{min-height:94px}
.msr[data-msr-structure="relaxed"] .msr-rows{gap:15px}
.msr[data-msr-structure="structured"] .msr-time{font-weight:800}
@media(max-width:1080px){.msr-preview{order:0}.msr-editor{order:1}.msr-layout{display:flex;flex-direction:column}}
@media print{.msr-edit-rows,.msr-customize,.msr-editor{visibility:hidden!important}}

@media(max-width:1080px){.msr-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.msr-editor{max-width:720px}}
@page{size:letter portrait;margin:0}
@media print{html,body{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;background:#fff!important}body *{visibility:hidden!important}.msr-stage,.msr-sheet,.msr-sheet *{visibility:visible!important}.msr-stage{position:absolute!important;top:0!important;left:0!important;width:8.5in!important;height:11in!important}.msr-sheet{position:absolute!important;top:0!important;left:0!important;width:8.5in!important;height:11in!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;transform:none!important;print-color-adjust:exact!important;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact!important}.msr-icon{mix-blend-mode:normal!important}}

/* Prepared-plan shell shared in spirit with March and April. */
.msr{padding:0;max-width:none}
.msr-intro{display:none}
.msr-layout{gap:0;grid-template-columns:clamp(315px,28vw,410px) minmax(0,1fr)}
.msr-editor{min-width:0;background:#faf9f7;border:0;border-right:1px solid #e5e0e1;padding:15px clamp(17px,2vw,26px);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.msr-editor-head{border-top:5px solid #d4dfc4;padding-top:11px}
.msr-editor-head h2{font:400 clamp(23px,2.7vw,31px)/1.1 Georgia,serif;color:#4f654b;margin:10px 0 7px}
.msr-editor-head em{font-style:italic}
.msr-vision-button,.msr-edit-trigger{display:inline-flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;min-height:35px;background:none;border:0;padding:7px 0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;color:#4f654b;font:700 12px Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}
.msr-prepared{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe5d9;margin-top:17px;padding:15px}
.msr-prepared>strong{display:block;font:400 23px Georgia,serif;color:#4f654b;margin:8px 0}
.msr-prepared>p{font:12px/1.55 Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0 0 12px}
.msr-summary-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;border-top:1px solid #e4e9e0;padding:10px 0;font-size:12px}
.msr-summary-line b{font-size:12px;text-align:right;color:#4f654b}
.msr-subnote{font:11px/1.6 Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#686f64;margin:14px 0}
.msr-actions{margin-top:auto}
.msr-primary-actions>button[data-print]{width:100%;border:0;background:#4f654b;color:#fff;padding:13px;min-height:45px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.msr-actions .msr-download{margin-top:7px;min-height:36px}
.msr-actions .msr-reset{margin:4px auto;min-height:32px}
.msr-jump-edit{display:none}
